		</a>
		<p class="blurb">Zombies are more popular than ever in TV shows, movies, Zombie-walks, Zombie Parties and more.</p>
		<p class="more"><a href="/tutorials/high-tech-materials-create-horrific-zombie-hands-daniel-phillips/"><span class="ctaRedChevron">&rsaquo;</span>&nbsp;View How-To Article</a></p>
	</div>
	<div class="card">
		<div class="video-decor">video</div>		<a href="/tutorials/quick-fake-wound-prosthetic/">
			<p class="thumb"><img src="//www.smooth-on.com/pw/site/assets/files/1504/cheekwound.gif" alt="How To Make a Quick Silicone Wound Prosthetic" width="480" height="270"></p>
			<h3>How To Make a Quick Silicone Wound Prosthetic</h3>
